    <!-- Library + Queue redesign icons — 24x24 viewbox, matched set with TabIcons.axaml.
         A function the desktop app also has draws the desktop's own glyph (named in its comment;
         copied or stroke-expanded as described in PhoneIcons.axaml). Phone-only glyphs = 1.8u
         stroke (round caps/joins) expanded to fill; solid glyphs (note heads, bars) keep >=0.9u
         corner rounding.
         Each string carries the grid's corners ("M0 0ZM24 24Z", zero-area): PathIcon stretches
         Data's bounds to its box, so without them every glyph filled its box on its own bounds and
         the stroke weight changed from glyph to glyph. Size a box as the 24-grid (see PhoneIcons). -->
